{"unit_id":"SunYanbox__DSHToolGate#card-zh","repo":"SunYanbox/DSHToolGate","commit":"1f6eb0ee3dfd95017c6e61103b10610ebdfefdb8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Tool Gate 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话级插件工具门控插件。它在会话界面提供工具选择面板，并把选择保存为会话配置；可以按插件行查看工具、启用或禁用整组工具，也能设置后续会话沿用的默认选择。新会话可自动弹出面板，输入区按钮可随时重新打开。每个会话分别过滤模型提示中的工具，并在工具执行时再次检查禁用项；已开始的会话修改选择时会要求确认。适合希望控制每个 DSH 对话可用工具的用户。无需 API 密钥或外部服务，选择记录保存在本地状态文件中。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:34-55","lib/client.js:687-710","lib/policy.js:59-82","lib/store.js:94-102"]}
{"unit_id":"SunYanbox__DSHToolGate#card-en","repo":"SunYanbox/DSHToolGate","commit":"1f6eb0ee3dfd95017c6e61103b10610ebdfefdb8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Tool Gate adds a per-session tool picker to DSH web. Users disable plugin tool groups, save defaults, and reopen the panel. Disabled tools leave prompts and are blocked at execution; changing a started session requires confirmation. Choices stay local; no API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:34-55","lib/client.js:687-710","lib/policy.js:59-82","lib/store.js:94-102"]}
