{"unit_id":"SunYanbox__DSHToolGate#feature-1","repo":"SunYanbox/DSHToolGate","commit":"1f6eb0ee3dfd95017c6e61103b10610ebdfefdb8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Tool Gate 的功能「会话工具选择」：按插件分组展示当前工具并允许切换启用状态。新会话可自动弹出选择面板，也可从输入区按钮重新打开。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:687-710","lib/index.js:37-55"]}
